Maintainer: Dario Griffo <dariogriffo@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://zigtools.org/zls/install/
Package: zls-0
Version: ZLS_VERSION-BUILD_VERSION~DIST
Architecture: DEB_ARCH
Recommends: zig-0 (>= ZIG_VERSION)
Description: Language server for the Zig programming language (0.x series)
 zls is the Zig Language Server: completion, go-to-definition, diagnostics,
 inlay hints and formatting for Zig, spoken over the Language Server Protocol
 and understood by any editor with an LSP client.
 .
 This package carries the build for the Zig 0.x series and registers
 /usr/bin/zls through update-alternatives.
